OL,3,GNEWSADriver using Snapchat killed
OL,4,Afarmer in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer was fatally injured when a
OL,7,Fdriver using her mobile phone to access
OL,8,FSnapchat smashed into the back of his
OL,9,Fquad bike, a court has heard.
OL,11,FMichael Armstrong, 58, was on his way
OL,12,Fto care for his elderly father after
OL,13,Fwork when Ami Dronsfield, 36, hit him
OL,14,Fon the A697 in Northumberland in
OL,15,FNovember 2024, Newcastle Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FHis wife, who was quickly alerted to
OL,19,Fthe crash and saw the "horrific" scene
OL,20,Fof "carnage", said he was her
OL,21,F"soulmate" and Dronsfield had left
OL,22,Ftheir family "broken".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
